PREAMBLE & BLOOD PACT ACKNOWLEDGMENT

By reading, cloning, forking, compiling, or merely making eye contact with this repository—whether in an IDE or at a windswept crossroads at the stroke of midnight—you affix your signature in metaphorical (or literal) blood. You acknowledge that software engineering was a mistake, documentation is a myth, and all who enter here have abandoned any reasonable expectation of sanity, stability, or salvation. This software was forged in the depths of 3:00 AM panic, bound by sulfur, stitched together from hallucinated LLM outputs, deprecated StackOverflow answers from 2011, and pure spite.

